sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Escribano/Gestor
    participant Client as Frontend (Swing/Web)
    participant API as REST API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>Client: Iniciar nueva gestión
    Client->>API: POST /api/v1/gestion
    API->>API: Validar token JWT
    API->>API: Validar datos negocio
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO gestion
    DB-->>API: OK (ID)
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO registro_auditoria
    API-->>Client: 201 Created (GestionDTO)
    Client-->>User: Mostrar éxito y número de gestión
